      "content": "idk i feel like i'm just guessing half the time. sometimes it feels like there's stuff going on in the jar that i just can't see. like, are there any specific signs or visual cues that indicate the \"invisible\" microbial activity is actually healthy versus when things are just going bad? maybe something about the way the texture changes or the bubbles look?",
